# Mirror of the Flutter Web engine's fallback fonts: 724 files, ~21MB of
# immutable woff2 that nobody edits and that `scripts/fetch_gfonts_mirror.py`
# reproduces exactly from the Flutter SDK. Kept out of git for its size, but
# it is NOT optional at build time — without it the engine's font fallback
# 404s, and a failed fallback download is one it never stops retrying. See
# docs/web-deploy.md.
/web/gfonts/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
